  <section class="guide">
    <div class="wrap">

      <aside class="toc">
        <div class="toc-h">In this guide</div>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#support">Does pfSense support WireGuard?</a></li>
          <li><a href="#plus-vs-ce">pfSense Plus vs CE: what changes for WireGuard</a></li>
          <li><a href="#setup">Step-by-step setup</a></li>
          <li><a href="#site-to-site">Site-to-site between two appliances</a></li>
          <li><a href="#vs-openvpn">WireGuard vs OpenVPN on pfSense — real numbers</a></li>
